    fields:  # 923f
      statement: "Nim import edges place the module name in the name-slot with module_path and src set to the literal <unknown>, defeating refine_frameworks and is_test_file so all Nim imports are invisible (false-demotes jester/karax on nitter). INV-judod/WI-fozoh family."  # 923f
      root_cause: "The Nim import-edge producer emits the module name into the name-slot and leaves module_path/src as the literal <unknown> sentinel, so downstream consumers (refine_frameworks, is_test_file) cannot resolve the module."  # 923f
